<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</link><description>由于投资者担心人工智能建设的巨额投资的回报，美国科技股预计将连续第二天下跌。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses'&gt;由于挥之不去的人工智能担忧，美国科技股将继续下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks End Day Lower as AI-Driven Swings Whipsaw Investors&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/us-stock-index-futures-slide-as-ai-worries-fuel-tech-losses</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 07:51:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>波基几乎空手而归地结束了秘鲁的选举年</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/porky-ends-peru-s-election-year-nearly-empty-handed</link><description>傲慢的利马前市长拉斐尔·洛佩斯·阿利亚加今年三度竞选公职，试图成为秘鲁总统、参议员，最后再次成为首都市长。这位右翼商人接近这三者，并一路挑战选举当局，但最终只在市议会中获得一个席位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/porky-ends-peru-s-election-year-nearly-empty-handed'&gt;波基几乎空手而归地结束了秘鲁的选举年&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Porky Ends Peru’s Election Year Nearly Empty-Handed&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/porky-ends-peru-s-election-year-nearly-empty-handed</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:07:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Set for Gains After Late US Rebound: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</link><description>华尔街 2026 年最可靠的押注之一正开始失去其万无一失的地位。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade'&gt;股市崩盘蔓延至不太可能的市场，套利交易陷入困境&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Cracks in AI Stocks Sink The Once Reliable Carry Trade&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stocks-meltdown-spills-into-unlikely-market-sinking-carry-trade</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 14:01:11 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着逢低买家的出现，股市削减了人工智能驱动的损失</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/stocks-pare-ai-driven-losses-as-dip-buyers-emerge-video</link><description>剧烈的波动再次冲击了华尔街，逢低买入的投资者逐渐平息了曾一度将纳斯达克 100 指数推向熊市边缘的股票抛售。以科技股为主的指数下跌 1%，抵消了因人工智能行业前景担忧而导致的大部分暴跌。彭博新闻高级股票编辑埃里克·韦纳表示，控制通胀最终将成为美联储的重点。市场的注意力将越来越多地转向这一点。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/stocks-pare-ai-driven-losses-as-dip-buyers-emerge-video'&gt;随着逢低买家的出现，股市削减了人工智能驱动的损失&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Pare AI-Driven Losses as Dip Buyers Emerge&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-25/stocks-pare-ai-driven-losses-as-dip-buyers-emerge-video</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:21:45 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>